 "is_vocab": false,
 "stimulus_html": "You roll a pair of 4-sided dice with faces labeled 1 through 4.",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 517335,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "What are the odds for rolling a sum greater than 3?\n",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The sample space:</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Sums</b></td>\n<td><b>2<sup>nd</sup> roll</b></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>1<sup>st</sup> roll</b></td>\n<td><b>Choices</b></td>\n<td><b>1</b></td>\n<td><b>2</b></td>\n<td><b>3</b></td>\n<td><b>4</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><b>1</b></td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><b>2</b></td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><b>3</b></td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><b>4</b></td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>8</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The total number of outcomes: 16.</p>\n<p>The outcomes greater than three: 13.</p>\n<p>The number of outcomes not in the desired event is <span data-math=\"16{\\text{ }}-{\\text{ }}13{\\text{ }} = {\\text{ }}3\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The ratio of the number of equally likely outcomes in an event <span data-math=\"E\"></span> to the number of equally likely outcomes <i>not</i> in the event is called the odds for (or odds in favor of) the event.</p>\n<p>The odds in favor of your event are <span data-math=\"{\\text{13: 3}}\"></span>.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"13{:}3\">13{:}3</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 517336,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "What are the odds against both dice giving the same number?\n",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The sample space:</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Both Rolls</b></td>\n<td><b>2<sup>nd</sup> roll</b></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>1<sup>st</sup> roll</b></td>\n<td><b>Choices</b></td>\n<td><b>1</b></td>\n<td><b>2</b></td>\n<td><b>3</b></td>\n<td><b>4</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><b>1</b></td>\n<td>1,1</td>\n<td>1,2</td>\n<td>1,3</td>\n<td>1,4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><b>2</b></td>\n<td>2,1</td>\n<td>2.2</td>\n<td>2,3</td>\n<td>2,4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><b>3</b></td>\n<td>3,1</td>\n<td>3,2</td>\n<td>3,3</td>\n<td>3,4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><b>4</b></td>\n<td>4,1</td>\n<td>4,2</td>\n<td>4,3</td>\n<td>4,4</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The total number of outcomes: 16.</p>\n<p>The outcomes with both dice giving the same number: 4.</p>\n<p>The number of outcomes not in the desired event is <span data-math=\"16{\\text{ }}-{\\text{ }}4{\\text{ }} = {\\text{ }}12\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The ratio of the number of equally likely outcomes in an event <span data-math=\"E\"></span> to the number of equally likely outcomes <i>not</i> in the event is called the odds for (or odds in favor of) the event.</p>\n<p>The odds against your event are <span data-math=\"{\\text{12:4}}\"></span> or <span data-math=\"{\\text{3:1}}\"></span>.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"12{:}4 = 3{:}1\">12{:}4 = 3{:}1</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
